# Normalize to LF in the repository regardless of checkout platform. The primary dev
# target is WSL2/Linux (docs/model-recommendations.md §0.3), and the edit engine itself
# is line-ending-aware (docs/system-design.md §10.1) — mixed endings in the repo's own
# source would be exactly the kind of bug that engine exists to avoid introducing.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.whl binary
*.db binary
